Ensure search engines can access the actual content. Do not assume a Vite single-page application automatically delivers optimal SEO.

Use a suitable rendering strategy for public pages. If necessary, implement server-side rendering or prerendering for important public content and dynamic metadata. Make the chosen architecture compatible with the actual deployment target.

### Structured data

